2026-08-09T23:29:29Z   4. NEW INDEPENDENT SOURCE: data/uber_direct_statements.csv - 32 daily invoices from direct.uber.com/billing, walked across all 7 pages via table rows. This is the first check on Uber Direct that is not internal-consistency. Reconciled on TOTALS over the settled window, never day by day, because Uber's INVOICE date is not the DELIVERY date: the 2026-07-24 deliveries (A$68.78) were billed A$60.83 on the 24th and A$7.95 on the 27th. Confirmed by reading the 24th's deliveries directly - 14.12 + 23.86 return-completed + 0.00 cancelled + 14.89 + 15.91 = 68.78. The feed's 07-24 row was CORRECT and was nearly "fixed" into being wrong.
